===

Core Components

Core Components| Component        | Description                               | Example                   |
| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |
| Graph            | The overall workflow                      | Bus booking process       |
| Node             | A step in the workflow                    | Search buses              |
| Edge             | Connection between nodes                  | Search → Payment          |
| State            | Shared information                        | Source, destination, date |
| Conditional Edge | Chooses the next node based on conditions | Seats available?          |
| Start Node       | Entry point                               | User sends a request      |
| End Node         | Workflow completion                       | Ticket generated          |


