Why Use LangGraph?

Without LangGraph:

User
 │
 ▼
Step 1
 │
 ▼
Step 2
 │
 ▼
Step 3
 │
 ▼
End

Only a simple linear flow.

With LangGraph:

             User
               │
               ▼
        Understand Query
               │
      ┌────────┴────────┐
      ▼                 ▼
Search Bus         Ask Question
      │                 │
      └────────┬────────┘
               ▼
          Payment
               │
               ▼
        Generate Ticket

It supports branching and returning to earlier steps.

